% social.dl: who follows whom, and what follows from it.

follows(ann, bo).
follows(bo, ann).
follows(bo, cy).
follows(cy, dee).
follows(dee, eli).
follows(ann, fay).
follows(fay, cy).

% Two people are friends when each follows the other.
friends(X, Y) :- follows(X, Y), follows(Y, X).

% Whose posts can reach X, if everyone reshares what they see: everyone X
% follows, everyone they follow, and so on.
sees(X, Y) :- follows(X, Y).
sees(X, Z) :- follows(X, Y), sees(Y, Z).

% People who follow someone in common.
in_common(X, Y) :- follows(X, Z), follows(Y, Z), X != Y.

% Someone X might like to follow: followed by someone X follows, but not
% yet by X, and not X.
suggest(X, Z) :- follows(X, Y), follows(Y, Z), X != Z, not follows(X, Z).

?- sees(ann, Who).
?- suggest(ann, Who).
